]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> using our international courier services. We&#39;ll make sure your parcel arrives in a timely manner.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-much-is-it-to-send-a-parcel-to-india-from-the-uk?" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="2" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>How much is it to send a parcel to India from the UK?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>While India might be halfway around the world from the UK, we’ll always aim to give you a great service at a low price no matter the distance. You can send parcels up to 15kg anywhere with Evri.

See how cheap it is to send parcels to India:</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</th><!----></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>250g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£11.29</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>500g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£14.19</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>1kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£19.29</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>2kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£24.19</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>5kg+</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£44.49</span></td><!----></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><!----><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-d2116e83><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-2 e-button--icon-right e-button--link" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-d2116e83 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send parcels to India<!--]--></span></a></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="indian-national-holidays" class="section-wrapper" index="3" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Indian national holidays</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->While we aim to deliver parcels to India within 9 to 16 days, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Republic Day – <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->26/01/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Independence Day –<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> 15/08/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Mahatma Gandhi’s Birthday –<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> 02/10/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In addition to national holidays, India is also home to lots of regional and religious holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-to-post-to-india-from-the-uk" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How to post to India from the UK<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With Evri, you can pick between three methods to send a parcel to India from the UK:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your delivery online - we have over 9,000+ ParcelShops to choose from, including local convenience stores. You can also book in person at selected Post Offices. If you don&#39;t have a printer, you can print your label for free using our Print In ParcelShop devices.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-ParcelShops-open ParcelShops page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033aebd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Like our ParcelShops, you can book your delivery online and drop off your parcel. Scan your barcode, place your parcel into an available Locker and we’ll collect it, ready for delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Lockers-open Lockers page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_1024505c8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is taking a photo." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In need of a home or office collection? You can go online and book a courier collection on a day of your choosing. We’ll then provide you with a 1-hour collection window on the day so you’ll know when to expect us.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Courier collection-open Courier collection page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier collection<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="sending-multiple-parcels-to-india" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Sending multiple parcels to India</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can make use of our bulk integrations tool to start sending multiple international parcels in one go. Just follow the simple steps below:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ol><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Log in to your Evri account and head to our bulk integrations tool. Click the ‘Link Account’ button to connect your marketplace seller’s account. Choose from eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify and more, or upload your parcels using a CSV file<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Package and book your items before printing off your postage label at home or in-store<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ol><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-View integrations" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/customer/bulk-upload" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> View integrations<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="6" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="why-send-internationally-with-evri?" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Why send internationally with Evri?</h2><!----></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Phone icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Regular tracking updates</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Keep updated on your parcel&#39;s progress with end-to-end <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->tracking<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Money icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Parcel cover</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Passport icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Customs made easier</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we&#39;ll do the rest<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/fdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Printer icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Flexible printing options</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/b82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Strapped boxes icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Bulk send</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Success icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Trusted by top UK brands</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;re trusted to deliver for many of the UK&#39;s biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="what-you-can-and-can’t-send-to-india" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>What you can and can’t send to India</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can send lots of items to India from the UK. Read our full breakdown of <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/send/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->what you can and can&#39;t send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> internationally with Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You should also be sure to check the <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="https://www.iata.org/en/publications/dgr/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->and <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="https://www.caa.co.uk/passengers/Before-you-fly/Baggage/Banned-items/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->UK Civil Aviation Authority<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions when you send a parcel to India from the UK via air travel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="what-address-information-you-need-for-sending-parcels-to-india" class="section-wrapper" index="8" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>What address information you need for sending parcels to India</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When you send a parcel to India from the UK, simply enter the recipient’s postcode online and we’ll provide different address options for you to choose from.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ll make sure your label follows the correct format ready for printing. All you need to do is check the following information is accurate for your recipient:  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The recipient’s name<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The number and/or name of the house/flat<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The street name or number<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The district name<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The PIN code followed by the city town or village name<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The country name in capitals<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="faqs-about-sending-parcels-to-india-from-the-uk" class="faqs" index="9" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>FAQs about sending parcels to India from the UK</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How long does it take to ship to India?-open answer" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How long does it take to ship to India?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketoshiptoindia-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It takes an average of 9 to 16 days to deliver a parcel to India with Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Will I need to deal with customs when posting to India?-open answer" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Will I need to deal with customs when posting to India?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhenpostingtoindia-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is there import tax from the UK to India?-open answer" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is there import tax from the UK to India?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktoindia-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my international parcels?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my international parcels?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-te